IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LOCALPUT.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 HCONN PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
01 OBJECT-DESC.
  05 MQOD-OBJECTNAME PIC X(48) VALUE 'LOCAL.QUEUE'.
01 MESSAGE-DESC.
  05 MQMD-MSGID PIC X(24) VALUE 'MSG000000000000000000001'.
  05 MQMD-CORRELID PIC X(24) VALUE 'COR000000000000000000001'.
01 PUT-OPTIONS.
  05 MQPMO-OPTIONS PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
01 BUFFER-LENGTH PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 20.
01 MESSAGE-BUFFER PIC X(20) VALUE 'LOCAL-COMMITTED-PUT1'.
01 CC PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
01 REASON PIC S9(9) COMP VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
CALL 'MQPUT1' USING BY REFERENCE HCONN OBJECT-DESC MESSAGE-DESC
  PUT-OPTIONS BUFFER-LENGTH MESSAGE-BUFFER CC REASON.
IF CC NOT = 0 OR REASON NOT = 0
  MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
ELSE
  MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
END-IF.
STOP RUN.
